  "why": "The run is Bungo Stray Dogs Wan! 2, the second season of the chibi short spinoff, 12 episodes from 2026-07-02 to 2026-09-17 and still airing. anizip:19698 is the same run: it carries first-party SAME_AS ids to both mal:62883 and anilist:201667, gives the same count of 12, and its episode 1 goes out 2026-07-02T12:30Z, the day the members give as the start. cr:GMEHMEN75 is the bare Crunchyroll series page for Bungo Stray Dogs Wan!, with no episodes, count or dates of its own, and kitsu:50328 already files itself under it as PART_OF, so it holds the run. nf:80132126 is left unsettled: it is the Netflix Bungo Stray Dogs title dated 2016-01-01, and the roughly sixty episodes it lists are main series ones (The Dark Age, Double Black, Cannibalism, numbered blocks running to 61) with not one Wan! title among them, so it cannot be told whether the franchise page also carries this short season or covers only the main show."
